## Zero-Regression Law

### Definition

A regression is:

- A working method that breaks after a change
- A state transition that is no longer possible
- A guard that is removed or weakened
- A field that is deleted that other code depended on
- A UI path that is removed without replacement
- A cron that no longer runs or runs in an incorrect cadence
- A `write()` guard bypassed
- A `sudo()` removed without replacement authorization
- A HOT lead reclassified as COLD (or vice versa) without legitimate data cause

### Active Regression Hotspots (confirmed by open PRs)

These paths must be treated as regression-sensitive with extra scrutiny:

| Path | Risk | Source |
|---|---|---|
| `plasticos_web_leads/models/web_lead.py` HOT/COLD classification | Critical — 17 bugs previously identified | PR #83 |
| `web_lead.py` write guard on `intake_created` state | Critical — must block non-state field writes | PR #83 |
| `web_lead.py` `_process_hot_lead_simple` sudo gate | High — sudo was missing; now added | PR #83 |
| `web_lead.py` weight fallback cascade in `_merge_ai_and_vision` | High — was zero-filling, now 4-step cascade | PR #83 |
| `plasticos_intake/models/intake.py` `action_match_to_buyers()` | High — being wired in PR #85 | PR #85 |
| `plasticos_intake_match` `offer_id` FK | Medium — new nullable FK, additive only | PR #85 |
| `plasticos_buyer_match_engine/models/matcher.py` `typical_price` | Medium — was hardcoded 0.0, now sourced from Neo4j edge | PR #85 |

### Module Boundary Map (Full — all 29 modules)

```yaml
plasticos_accounting: financial models, gross margin, freight bill linking
plasticos_admin_dashboard: admin-facing dashboard (do not remove views)
plasticos_automation: scheduled actions, automation rules
plasticos_base: core models, shared fields, base config, ICP params
plasticos_buyer_match_engine: buyer matching logic and match scoring
plasticos_claims: claims management workflow
plasticos_commission: commission calculation (known circular dep with transaction — non-fatal)
plasticos_crm_bridge: CRM ↔ pipeline bridge
plasticos_dev_tools: dev/debug utilities — must be fenced off in production
plasticos_documents: document management (enterprise layer)
plasticos_documents_native: native document layer fallback
plasticos_enrichment: data enrichment pipelines (intentional stub — gated on pipeline_v2.py bridge)
plasticos_facility_profile: facility/supplier profile records
plasticos_geolocalize: geolocation services
plasticos_inference_engine: AI inference — pipeline_v2.py IS DEFERRED; pure-Python engines active
plasticos_intake: material intake UI + matching trigger
plasticos_intake_normalizer: normalizes intake data for matching
plasticos_logistics: shipping, freight, logistics tracking
plasticos_matching: core buyer-seller match orchestration
plasticos_material_profile: material taxonomy (polymer, form, resin grade)
plasticos_odoo_standard_apps: standard app configuration/extension
plasticos_offer: offer records (sent to buyers)
plasticos_order_lines: order line extensions
plasticos_partner_import: CSV/bulk partner import tooling
plasticos_product: product template extensions
plasticos_security_base: access control, record rules, groups
plasticos_transaction: transaction lifecycle management (known circular dep with commission)
plasticos_web_leads: website lead capture — HOT/COLD classification critical path
plasticos_website: frontend/website customizations
```

### Regression Detection Commands

```bash
# State guard bypass detection:
python3 ci/check_state_guard_bypass.py

# ORM integrity (field deletions, removed compute):
python3 ci/check_orm_integrity.py

# Field integrity (missing fields referenced):
python3 ci/check_field_integrity.py

# Run module tests before and after a change:
make test-module m=<module>
```

### Regression Verdict

```yaml
regression_verdict:
  no_working_method_broken: true
  no_state_transition_removed: true
  no_guard_weakened: true
  no_field_deleted_without_migration: true
  no_cron_broken: true
  write_guard_intact: true
  hot_cold_classification_stable: true
  pipeline_v2_still_deferred: true
  commission_transaction_circular_dep_acknowledged: true
```

